%I A399824 #4 Sep 18 2026 00:01:03
%S A399824 1,0,1,1,4,26,236,2752,49288,1272392,47725952,2549384344
%N A399824 Number of labeled neighborhood anti-Sperner graphs on n vertices.
%C A399824 A graph G is neighborhood anti-Sperner if for every vertex u there exists a distinct vertex v such that N_G(u) is a subset of N_G(v), where N_G(u) denotes the open neighborhood of u.
%H A399824 L. H. Clark, S. Holliday, J. P. McSorley and T. D. Porter, <a href="https://opensiuc.lib.siu.edu/math_articles/119/">Enumerating labelled graphs with certain neighborhood properties</a>, Congressus Numerantium 190 (2008), 193-206.
%H A399824 J. P. McSorley, <a href="https://opensiuc.lib.siu.edu/math_articles/37/">Constructing and classifying neighborhood anti-Sperner graphs</a>, Discrete Mathematics 308 (2008), 5428-5445.
%e A399824 a(4) = 4: the empty graph and the three labeled copies of C_4.
%Y A399824 Cf. A399822 (labeled neighborhood-Sperner graphs).
%K A399824 nonn,more,new
%O A399824 0,5
